 </a> <div class="header-dropdown nav-outils" data-header-dropdown data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc> <button type="button" id="nav-outils-trigger" class="nav-dropdown__trigger" data-dropdown-trigger aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-outils-panel" aria-haspopup="true" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc> Outils <span class="nav-dropdown__caret" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>▾</span> </button> <div id="nav-outils-panel" class="nav-outils__panel" data-dropdown-panel hidden role="menu" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc> <a href="/domotique/configurateur-projet-domotique/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>⚡ Configurateur Domotique</a><a href="/domotique/codes-erreurs-domotique/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>🔧 Codes erreurs</a><a href="/domotique/pieces-detachees-sav-domotique/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Pièces détachées &amp; SAV</a><a href="/outils/quel-robot-educatif-choisir/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Quel robot éducatif choisir ?</a><a href="/configurateur-kit-robotique-classe/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Configurateur kit classe</a><a href="/calculateur-budget-robot-classe/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Calculateur budget classe</a><a href="/compatibilite-makeblock/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Compatibilité Makeblock mBot</a><a href="/tableau-reglages-capteurs-mbot2-depannage/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Réglages capteurs mBot2</a><a href="/mblock-depannage-codes-erreurs-mbot-arduino/" role="menuitem" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>Dépannage mBlock &amp; codes mBot</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="header-actions" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc> <a class="header-cta desktop-only" href="/domotique/configurateur-projet-domotique/" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc>⚡ Configurateur</a> <button id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Passer en mode sombre" class="theme-toggle header-icon-btn" data-astro-cid-lv5sydnc> <svg class="sun-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width